# Signal Inbox

Source adapters may produce candidates, but candidates are not operational state.

Every candidate must eventually become one of: `promoted`, `dismissed`, `superseded`, `needs_verification`, or `ignored_noise`.

When {{COS_NAME}} reviews a candidate, record reviewed_at, reviewed_by, decision, destination if promoted, reason, and superseded_by if applicable.

Do not leave stale candidates marked `new` after they influence [[Operations/ACTION_LEDGER.md]], [[Operations/DECISION_QUEUE.md]], a domain note, [[Backlog.md]], or [[Notes and Journal.md]].

